":["This proposal evaluates only the retained circular's classification routes for one Fund at a specified assessment time.","The circular is applicable at that assessment time; the packet does not establish commencement.","The threshold fact must be supplied using a supported exposure methodology, not inferred from illustrative holdings or disclosure language.","An operative SFC designation requires evidence of an actual designation; risk factors or the possibility of designation are insufficient.","Unknown scope, exposure or designation facts remain unknown. Absence of designation evidence is not evidence of no designation."],"citations":[{"quote":"funds that are authorised by the SFC for offering to the public in Hong Kong (Funds)6","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u4.564"},{"quote":"6 Except for listed closed-ended alternative asset funds (LAFs).","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u63.8691"},{"quote":"A Fund will be considered as a complex product if its total direct and indirect exposures to private market assets amount to 50% or more of the Fund’s NAV.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779"},{"quote":"On a case-by-case basis, the SFC may also designate a Fund as a complex product, taking into account factors including, without limitation:","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779"},{"quote":"the SFC will adopt a holistic approach taking into account the specific circumstances of the case.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u29.4630"},{"quote":"In cases where the Fund’s aggregate direct and indirect exposures to private market assets are less than 50% of the Fund’s NAV.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u64.8910"},{"quote":"including but not limited to ensuring the suitability of the Fund for its investors irrespective of whether solicitation or recommendation is involved.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u32.4805"},{"quote":"Fund managers are encouraged to consult the SFC at the earliest opportunity if they are in doubt regarding complex product classification of their Funds.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u49.6955"}],"distinction":"The substantive distinction is automatic classification at the inclusive 50% threshold versus an actual discretionary SFC designation below it. Neither private-market exposure alone nor an adverse risk factor automatically establishes classification. LAF exclusion removes this circular's route without establishing that a LAF is non-complex under other rules. The text supports this single classification reading more strongly than competing automatic-classification rules; uncertainty chiefly concerns measurement, timing and missing evidence.","family":"modality","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"Whether the assessed fund is authorised by the SFC for offering to the public in Hong Kong at the assessment time.","name":"public_sfc_authorised","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u4.564"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"Whether the assessed fund is a listed closed-ended alternative asset fund within the footnote 6 exclusion.","name":"is_laf","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u63.8691"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"Whether the Fund's total direct and indirect exposure to private market assets amounts to at least 50% of its NAV at the assessment time, using the applicable methodology. Missing or unresolved measurement evidence leaves this fact unknown.","name":"aggregate_exposure_at_least_half_nav","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u1.5","d4148dd852cee.u21.3779","d4148dd852cee.u59.7979"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"Whether an SFC case-by-case designation of this Fund as a complex product under this circular is operative at the assessment time. Mere designation risk or missing records does not establish either truth value.","name":"operative_sfc_designation","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u21.3779","d4148dd852cee.u29.4630","d4148dd852cee.u64.8910"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"}],"result":"(or aggregate_exposure_at_least_half_nav operative_sfc_designation)","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and public_sfc_authorised (not is_laf))"},"local_id":"classification_routes","questions":["How is aggregate exposure measured and evidenced for the Fund at the relevant time?","Is there an actual operative SFC designation, rather than only circumstances that could justify one?","If exposure subsequently falls below 50%, what rules govern continued classification?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] Selected control: whether the retained circular's complex-product classification trigger is satisfied for an in-scope Fund at the assessment time. True means aggregate direct and indirect private-market exposure reaches at least 50% of NAV, or an operative SFC case-by-case designation exists, so the Fund must be treated as complex for distribution under this reading. False means both routes are affirmatively absent; it does not establish general non-complex status, compliance with sales duties or exemption under other instruments. An out-of-scope Fund receives no classification decision from this control. Missing evidence remains unresolved rather than producing false.","subject":"Complex-product classification trigger for an SFC-authorised public Fund, excluding LAFs"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.65050459a1ce3ffe5cff6887","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":1},{"bundle_hash":"58c57271fe995cd31b8d3fa7d190721a5c50503976bfb492a113dd370d0af7fa","candidate_id":"candidate.7c68637ad5624ac1b716251841a70dd7","commitment":"e991458c263a94343322e33e1bc7bd4ab4cba74362224ef44e923d4af3132d2e","depth":0,"disposition":"UNREVIEWED","encoding_error":null,"expanded":false,"issued_calls":0,"node_id":"node.e991458c263a94343322e33e","order":1,"parent":null,"reading":{"assumptions":["This proposal answers only whether either classification route stated in the retained circular is satisfied for a fund within its defined scope.","All facts refer to the same assessment occasion. The packet does not supply the governing assessment date or measurement protocol.","The threshold fact is supplied only after the applicable exposure basis has been established; it is not inferred from the existence of private-market exposure or from disclosure examples.","An operative SFC designation requires evidence of the SFC's decision. Risk factors, consultation, closer scrutiny and missing records do not establish or negate that decision.","A false scope excludes the fund from this selected control; it does not classify the fund as non-complex under another regime."],"citations":[{"quote":"funds that are authorised by the SFC for offering to the public in Hong Kong (Funds)6","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u4.564"},{"quote":"private credit and private equity (collectively, private market assets)","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u1.5"},{"quote":"A Fund will be considered as a complex product if its total direct and indirect exposures to private market assets amount to 50% or more of the Fund’s NAV.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779"},{"quote":"On a case-by-case basis, the SFC may also designate a Fund as a complex product, taking into account factors including, without limitation:","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779"},{"quote":"In assessing whether the complex product designation is warranted7, the SFC will adopt a holistic approach taking into account the specific circumstances of the case.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u29.4630"},{"quote":"7 In cases where the Fund’s aggregate direct and indirect exposures to private market assets are less than 50% of the Fund’s NAV.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u64.8910"},{"quote":"6 Except for listed closed-ended alternative asset funds (LAFs).","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u63.8691"},{"quote":"including but not limited to ensuring the suitability of the Fund for its investors irrespective of whether solicitation or recommendation is involved.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u32.4805"},{"quote":"Fund managers are encouraged to consult the SFC at the earliest opportunity if they are in doubt regarding complex product classification of their Funds.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u49.6955"}],"distinction":"The source supports two distinct routes, rather than two rival interpretations of the 50% rule: automatic classification at or above 50%, and discretionary SFC designation below it. Below-threshold exposure alone does not establish non-complex status. The strongest unresolved interpretive issue is the exposure measurement basis: current exposure and permitted exposure can yield different threshold outcomes, but the packet does not adequately specify a competing executable measurement rule.","family":"modality","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"Whether the assessed fund is authorised by the SFC for offering to the public in Hong Kong.","name":"authorised_public_hk","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u4.564"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"Whether the assessed fund is a listed closed-ended alternative asset fund within the footnote 6 exclusion.","name":"is_laf","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u63.8691"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"Whether the fund's total direct and indirect exposure to private credit and private equity amounts to at least 50% of its NAV on the applicable assessment basis. Unknown if the exposure evidence or governing measurement basis is unresolved.","name":"aggregate_exposure_at_least_50_percent","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u1.5","d4148dd852cee.u21.3779","d4148dd852cee.u59.7979","d4148dd852cee.u62.8487"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean; underlying threshold is 50 percent of NAV"},{"meaning":"Whether an SFC case-specific designation of the fund as a complex product under this circular is operative at the assessment occasion. A possible designation or absence of designation evidence leaves this fact unknown.","name":"operative_sfc_designation","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u21.3779","d4148dd852cee.u29.4630","d4148dd852cee.u64.8910"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"}],"result":"(or aggregate_exposure_at_least_50_percent operative_sfc_designation)","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and authorised_public_hk (not is_laf))"},"local_id":"classification_routes","questions":["What measurement evidence supports the aggregate threshold fact for the assessed fund?","Is there evidence establishing or excluding an operative case-specific SFC designation?","Does any absent guidance specify a mandate-based test, a reassessment interval or a declassification procedure?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] For an in-scope Fund, true means the retained circular's selected complex-product classification condition is satisfied: aggregate direct and indirect private-market exposure is at least 50% of NAV, or an operative SFC case-specific designation applies. The Fund must then be treated as complex for distribution under this control. False means both routes are established to be absent at the assessment occasion; it does not establish non-complex status under all other rules. Missing exposure or designation evidence remains unknown unless a known satisfied route already determines the result. This predicate does not assess compliance with the resulting sale requirements.","subject":"Selected control: complex-product classification for distribution under the retained circular"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.e991458c263a94343322e33e","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0},{"bundle_hash":"c7b206d931f70fc417bcc9d7047a159b7d37bd54e34ff128260703ab058cc295","candidate_id":"candidate.bfbb050f2d2d46cb9d3e2d3cccf6764a","commitment":"68f8e39cf8e43c95a1e0890d1a7fe7a0b657c163d522f926468e32bea8b0dadc","depth":0,"disposition":"UNREVIEWED","encoding_error":null,"expanded":false,"issued_calls":0,"node_id":"node.68f8e39cf8e43c95a1e0890d","order":2,"parent":null,"reading":{"assumptions":["The formalization evaluates one particular fund at one identified assessment time; it does not determine whole-firm compliance or satisfaction of the downstream sales requirements.","Footnote 6 qualifies the defined population of Funds, and footnote 7 qualifies the holistic designation assessment in cases below 50%.","The designation fact records an actual, applicable SFC designation. A manager's view that designation is likely or appropriate does not establish that fact.","The threshold fact must be established using a supportable exposure measurement. The formalization supplies no missing valuation, look-through, aggregation or monitoring convention.","A result is interpreted only within the Boolean scope. Unknown facts are not assigned false values; one established true classification route can nevertheless establish the result without resolving the other route."],"citations":[{"quote":"This circular provides guidance to management companies of funds that are authorised by the SFC for offering to the public in Hong Kong (Funds)6 in this regard.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u4.564"},{"quote":"Except for listed closed-ended alternative asset funds (LAFs).","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u63.8691"},{"quote":"A Fund will be considered as a complex product if its total direct and indirect exposures to private market assets amount to 50% or more of the Fund’s NAV.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779"},{"quote":"On a case-by-case basis, the SFC may also designate a Fund as a complex product, taking into account factors including, without limitation:","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779"},{"quote":"In assessing whether the complex product designation is warranted7, the SFC will adopt a holistic approach taking into account the specific circumstances of the case.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u29.4630"},{"quote":"In cases where the Fund’s aggregate direct and indirect exposures to private market assets are less than 50% of the Fund’s NAV.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u64.8910"},{"quote":"A Fund classified as a complex product will be subject to the SFC’s prevailing requirements for the sale of complex products8 including but not limited to ensuring the suitability of the Fund for its investors irrespective of whether solicitation or recommendation is involved.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u32.4805"},{"quote":"Fund managers are encouraged to consult the SFC at the earliest opportunity if they are in doubt regarding complex product classification of their Funds.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u49.6955"}],"distinction":"The threshold sentence uses mandatory language, while the below-threshold route requires an SFC designation and permits a holistic assessment. For example, an in-scope Fund with established aggregate exposure of exactly 50% satisfies the trigger without a separate designation. A Fund at 49% with established absence of an SFC designation does not satisfy this selected trigger merely because its CLO holdings or liquidity profile warrant scrutiny; a Fund at 49% that has actually been designated does satisfy it. An otherwise comparable LAF falls outside this circular's defined Fund scope. A Fund whose exposure or designation history is missing cannot be treated as the established 49%-and-undesignated case. Footnote 7 supports attaching holistic assessment to cases below 50%, rather than making the express 50% threshold discretionary. The strongest uncertainty is how to establish aggregate exposure for layered instruments and the relevant assessment date.","family":"modality","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"Whether the particular fund is authorised by the SFC for offering to the public in Hong Kong at the assessment time.","name":"sfc_authorised_public_fund","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u4.564"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean fund-scope fact"},{"meaning":"Whether the particular fund falls within the listed closed-ended alternative asset fund category excluded by footnote 6. An unresolved category classification remains unknown.","name":"listed_closed_ended_alternative_asset_fund","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u63.8691"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean exclusion fact"},{"meaning":"Whether established total direct and indirect exposure to private market assets amounts to at least 50% of the Fund's NAV at the assessment time. Supplying this fact requires resolving applicable exposure measurement and aggregation; missing holdings or measurement evidence is not false.","name":"aggregate_private_market_exposure_at_least_half_nav","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u1.5","d4148dd852cee.u21.3779","d4148dd852cee.u59.7979","d4148dd852cee.u60.8163","d4148dd852cee.u61.8338","d4148dd852cee.u62.8487"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean inclusive 50%-of-NAV threshold fact"},{"meaning":"Whether an actual SFC case-by-case designation of the particular Fund as a complex product applies at the assessment time. Mere risk factors, possible designation or an unsearched designation history do not establish a positive or negative value.","name":"applicable_sfc_complex_product_designation","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u21.3779","d4148dd852cee.u29.4630","d4148dd852cee.u64.8910"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean applicable-designation fact"}],"result":"(or aggregate_private_market_exposure_at_least_half_nav applicable_sfc_complex_product_designation)","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and sfc_authorised_public_fund (not listed_closed_ended_alternative_asset_fund))"},"local_id":"classification_trigger","questions":["How should indirect exposure through BDCs, CLOs, TRSs and SRTs be measured and aggregated, including look-through, derivative exposure and possible double counting?","What valuation date, monitoring frequency and treatment of temporary threshold crossings govern the 50% test?","What evidence establishes an applicable SFC designation, its effective date and any subsequent withdrawal or replacement?","Does omitted commencement or transitional material specify when existing Funds must complete classification changes and distributor communications?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] For an SFC-authorised fund offered to the public in Hong Kong that is not a listed closed-ended alternative asset fund, the classification trigger is satisfied when its aggregate direct and indirect exposure to private market assets is at least 50% of NAV, or when the SFC has actually designated it as a complex product on a case-by-case basis. True means that this circular supplies a basis requiring complex-product treatment for distribution. False, within scope and with the relevant facts established, means that neither classification route is established under this selected control; it does not establish non-complex status under every other applicable rule. Missing exposure or designation evidence remains unknown. The retained text supports one classification structure; the principal unresolved issues concern exposure measurement, timing and evidence, rather than a competing rule making every private-market exposure automatically complex.","subject":"Selected control: whether the retained circular triggers complex-product treatment for distribution of a particular Fund"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.68f8e39cf8e43c95a1e0890d","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0},{"bundle_hash":"4667f572c143e614eef24dd953a702adb0d536f7a43c7854b0e90fe4cd0f0dc7","candidate_id":"candidate.3f8a5036e953435d9fec7c7aa9696354","commitment":"ad3ed6f7c586444ec7213491691980dde1de00675aff2f8415163372e6e85bdf","depth":0,"disposition":"UNREVIEWED","encoding_error":null,"expanded":false,"issued_calls":0,"node_id":"node.ad3ed6f7c586444ec7213491","order":3,"parent":null,"reading":{"assumptions":["The assessment concerns one SFC-authorised fund offered to the public in Hong Kong; listed closed-ended alternative asset funds are excluded from this circular's scope.","Direct exposure, indirect exposure and NAV are measured at the same assessment time in a common exact valuation unit. Integer inputs require an exact common scale, without rounding at the 50% boundary.","The supplied exposure amounts use an established measurement and aggregation method that avoids unintended double counting. The retained text does not establish that method.","An SFC designation means an actual designation applicable to this Fund at the assessment time; risk factors or enhanced scrutiny alone do not establish designation.","The result addresses classification under this circular, not overall distribution compliance or classification under other instruments."],"citations":[{"quote":"This circular provides guidance to management companies of funds that are authorised by the SFC for offering to the public in Hong Kong (Funds)6 in this regard.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u4.564"},{"quote":"A Fund will be considered as a complex product if its total direct and indirect exposures to private market assets amount to 50% or more of the Fund’s NAV. On a case-by-case basis, the SFC may also designate a Fund as a complex product, taking into account factors including, without limitation:","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779"},{"quote":"In assessing whether the complex product designation is warranted7, the SFC will adopt a holistic approach taking into account the specific circumstances of the case.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u29.4630"},{"quote":"In cases where the Fund’s aggregate direct and indirect exposures to private market assets are less than 50% of the Fund’s NAV.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u64.8910"},{"quote":"Except for listed closed-ended alternative asset funds (LAFs).","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u63.8691"},{"quote":"A Fund classified as a complex product will be subject to the SFC’s prevailing requirements for the sale of complex products8 including but not limited to ensuring the suitability of the Fund for its investors irrespective of whether solicitation or recommendation is involved.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u32.4805"},{"quote":"The examples of indirect exposures set out in paragraph 1 above are non-exhaustive, and subject to review and update by the SFC from time to time in view of market developments.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u59.7979"},{"quote":"Fund managers are encouraged to consult the SFC at the earliest opportunity if they are in doubt regarding complex product classification of their Funds.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u49.6955"}],"distinction":"The model separates the Fund from its underlying assets and intermediate instruments, adds direct and indirect exposure, and distinguishes an automatic threshold from an actual discretionary SFC decision. Neither below-threshold exposure nor missing designation evidence establishes non-complex status. LAF exclusion is a scope exclusion, not a finding that the fund is non-complex. The separate 15% direct-investment limit is not this classification threshold.","family":"scope","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The assessed fund is authorised by the SFC for offering to the public in Hong Kong at the assessment time.","name":"sfc_authorised_public_fund","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u4.564"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean for the assessed fund at the assessment time"},{"meaning":"The assessed fund is a listed closed-ended alternative asset fund within the stated LAF exclusion.","name":"is_laf","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u63.8691"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean fund-category determination"},{"meaning":"Aggregate direct exposure to private credit and private equity, measured under the supplied exposure methodology at the assessment time.","name":"direct_exposure","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u1.5","d4148dd852cee.u21.3779"],"type":"integer","unit":"Exact common valuation units, identical to those used for indirect_exposure and nav"},{"meaning":"Aggregate indirect exposure to private credit and private equity through all relevant holdings and instruments, including qualifying exposures beyond the listed examples, measured under the supplied methodology at the assessment time.","name":"indirect_exposure","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u1.5","d4148dd852cee.u21.3779","d4148dd852cee.u59.7979"],"type":"integer","unit":"Exact common valuation units, identical to those used for direct_exposure and nav"},{"meaning":"The Fund's total net asset value at the same assessment time as the exposure amounts.","name":"nav","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u21.3779","d4148dd852cee.u58.7778"],"type":"integer","unit":"Exact common valuation units, identical to those used for direct_exposure and indirect_exposure"},{"meaning":"The SFC has actually made a case-specific complex-product designation for this Fund that applies at the assessment time. Unknown designation evidence leaves this fact unknown.","name":"applicable_sfc_designation","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u21.3779","d4148dd852cee.u29.4630","d4148dd852cee.u64.8910"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean for an applicable SFC decision concerning the assessed fund"}],"result":"(or (>= (+ (+ direct_exposure indirect_exposure) (+ direct_exposure indirect_exposure)) nav) applicable_sfc_designation)","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and sfc_authorised_public_fund (not is_laf) (> nav (integer 0)))"},"local_id":"classification_routes","questions":["Is the assessed fund authorised by the SFC for public offering in Hong Kong, and is it a listed closed-ended alternative asset fund?","What are the Fund's direct exposure, indirect exposure and positive NAV at the assessment time?","What measurement rules govern indirect exposure, derivatives, look-through, netting and overlapping exposures, and can the amounts be represented exactly on a common scale?","Has the SFC actually designated this Fund as a complex product, and is that designation applicable at the assessment time?","What assessment date, valuation frequency and treatment of temporary threshold crossings apply? The retained text does not specify these.","What do the unavailable LAF circular and prevailing distribution requirements provide for an excluded fund or a classified Fund?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] For an in-scope Fund with positive NAV, does either classification route under this circular require treating the Fund as a complex product for distribution at the assessment time? True means total direct and indirect private-market exposure is at least 50% of NAV, or an applicable SFC designation exists. False means exposure is below 50% and no applicable designation exists; it does not establish non-complex status under other rules or prevent future designation. Missing facts remain unknown, and an out-of-scope fund receives no classification answer. This is a classification predicate, not legal approval or a compliance finding.","subject":"Complex-product classification of an individual Fund for distribution"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.ad3ed6f7c586444ec7213491","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0},{"bundle_hash":null,"candidate_id":"candidate.66494e0468ec433f93bcaba7b26f0a76","commitment":"e0f879754935c6d04e666dfa292f253ce2817d74cd625823a88b77b0e34e75df","depth":0,"disposition":"UNREVIEWED","encoding_error":{"code":"E_UNSUPPORTED_PROFILE","details":"Unsupported operator or arity: +"},"expanded":false,"issued_calls":0,"node_id":"node.e0f879754935c6d04e666dfa","order":4,"parent":null,"reading":{"assumptions":["Assessment concerns one SFC-authorised fund for public offering in Hong Kong; listed closed-ended alternative asset funds are excluded from this circular.","Direct exposure, indirect exposure and NAV are measured on a consistent basis at the relevant assessment time. Their amounts are supplied as exact integers in a common accounting unit without rounding across the 50% boundary.","The measurement methodology and treatment of layered exposures must be established separately; the circular does not supply a complete calculation method.","An operative SFC designation is a separate institutional act. Risk factors or potential scrutiny alone do not establish that designation.","The result identifies a complex-product classification basis under this circular, not overall distribution compliance or legal approval."],"citations":[{"quote":"This circular provides guidance to management companies of funds that are authorised by the SFC for offering to the public in Hong Kong (Funds)6 in this regard.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u4.564"},{"quote":"A Fund will be considered as a complex product if its total direct and indirect exposures to private market assets amount to 50% or more of the Fund’s NAV.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779"},{"quote":"On a case-by-case basis, the SFC may also designate a Fund as a complex product, taking into account factors including, without limitation:","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779"},{"quote":"In assessing whether the complex product designation is warranted7, the SFC will adopt a holistic approach taking into account the specific circumstances of the case.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u29.4630"},{"quote":"7 In cases where the Fund’s aggregate direct and indirect exposures to private market assets are less than 50% of the Fund’s NAV.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u64.8910"},{"quote":"6 Except for listed closed-ended alternative asset funds (LAFs).","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u63.8691"},{"quote":"A Fund classified as a complex product will be subject to the SFC’s prevailing requirements for the sale of complex products8 including but not limited to ensuring the suitability of the Fund for its investors irrespective of whether solicitation or recommendation is involved.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u32.4805"},{"quote":"Fund managers are encouraged to consult the SFC at the earliest opportunity if they are in doubt regarding complex product classification of their Funds.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u49.6955"}],"distinction":"The mandatory 50% test aggregates direct and indirect exposure at fund level. Below 50%, the listed factors support SFC discretion rather than automatic classification; an actual designation must be distinguished from circumstances that could justify one. LAF exclusion is a scope exclusion, not a finding that the product is non-complex. Missing exposure or designation evidence remains unknown. Classification timing is also distinct from the instruction to update existing funds’ documents as soon as practicable.","family":"scope","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The assessed fund is authorised by the SFC for offering to the public in Hong Kong at the assessment time.","name":"authorised_public_fund","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u4.564"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean per fund at assessment time"},{"meaning":"The assessed fund belongs to the category of listed closed-ended alternative asset funds excluded by footnote 6.","name":"is_laf","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u63.8691"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean per fund at assessment time"},{"meaning":"Direct exposure to private market assets, measured using the established exposure methodology and expressed exactly in the same accounting unit as indirect exposure and NAV.","name":"direct_exposure","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u1.5","d4148dd852cee.u21.3779"],"type":"integer","unit":"Common exact accounting units"},{"meaning":"Aggregate indirect exposure to private market assets through all relevant intermediary investments and financial instruments, measured using the established methodology in the same accounting unit as direct exposure and NAV.","name":"indirect_exposure","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u1.5","d4148dd852cee.u21.3779","d4148dd852cee.u59.7979"],"type":"integer","unit":"Common exact accounting units"},{"meaning":"The fund’s NAV at the assessment time, expressed exactly in the same accounting unit as both exposure amounts.","name":"fund_nav","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u21.3779"],"type":"integer","unit":"Common exact accounting units"},{"meaning":"The SFC has made a case-specific designation of this fund as a complex product that is operative at the assessment time. Absence of evidence does not establish false.","name":"operative_sfc_designation","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u21.3779","d4148dd852cee.u29.4630","d4148dd852cee.u64.8910"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean per fund at assessment time"}],"result":"(or (>= (+ direct_exposure indirect_exposure direct_exposure indirect_exposure) fund_nav) operative_sfc_designation)","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and authorised_public_fund (not is_laf) (> fund_nav (integer 0)))"},"local_id":"classification_basis","questions":["Is the fund authorised for public offering in Hong Kong, and is it a listed closed-ended alternative asset fund?","What are the direct exposure, indirect exposure and NAV at the relevant assessment time, and what methodology establishes comparable amounts without inappropriate double counting?","Has the SFC designated this fund as complex, and is that designation operative at the assessment time?","What effective date, measurement frequency and treatment of temporary threshold crossings apply? The retained text does not specify them.","What additional classification or sale requirements apply under the referenced instruments, including the separate LAF circular and prevailing complex-product distribution requirements?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] Within scope, does the fund meet a complex-product classification basis under this circular at the assessment time? True means aggregate direct and indirect exposure is at least 50% of NAV, or an operative SFC case-specific designation exists. False means neither basis is present on established facts; it does not establish non-complex status under other requirements. Unknown inputs remain unknown unless the other branch independently establishes true. An excluded fund receives no classification conclusion from this model.","subject":"Fund-level complex-product classification for distribution"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.e0f879754935c6d04e666dfa","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0},{"bundle_hash":null,"candidate_id":"candidate.0e03bd01c408439b90622fb2208a4b82","commitment":"11d4e8e1976eb5b2900022be6b196a7730165e4b1db8a27466b501d80190a922","depth":0,"disposition":"UNREVIEWED","encoding_error":{"code":"E_UNSUPPORTED_PROFILE","details":"Unsupported operator or arity: +"},"expanded":false,"issued_calls":0,"node_id":"node.11d4e8e1976eb5b2900022be","order":5,"parent":null,"reading":{"assumptions":["The assessment concerns one fund at one identified distribution assessment time; listed closed-ended alternative asset funds are excluded.","Direct exposure, indirect exposure and positive NAV are supplied as exact integers in the same valuation unit at that time, under a separately established aggregation methodology.","Indirect exposure covers all relevant instruments and underlying private credit or private equity; the listed examples are not an exhaustive instrument whitelist.","A designation input records an actual SFC decision applicable at the assessment time; scrutiny, risk characteristics and home-regulator restrictions do not themselves establish designation.","The result answers whether a classification basis under this circular is present. It does not determine historical classification persistence, overall distribution compliance or legal approval."],"citations":[{"quote":"This circular provides guidance to management companies of funds that are authorised by the SFC for offering to the public in Hong Kong (Funds)6 in this regard.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u4.564"},{"quote":"A Fund will be considered as a complex product if its total direct and indirect exposures to private market assets amount to 50% or more of the Fund’s NAV. On a case-by-case basis, the SFC may also designate a Fund as a complex product, taking into account factors including, without limitation:","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779"},{"quote":"In assessing whether the complex product designation is warranted7, the SFC will adopt a holistic approach taking into account the specific circumstances of the case.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u29.4630"},{"quote":"In cases where the Fund’s aggregate direct and indirect exposures to private market assets are less than 50% of the Fund’s NAV.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u64.8910"},{"quote":"Except for listed closed-ended alternative asset funds (LAFs).","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u63.8691"},{"quote":"The examples of indirect exposures set out in paragraph 1 above are non-exhaustive, and subject to review and update by the SFC from time to time in view of market developments.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u59.7979"},{"quote":"A Fund classified as a complex product will be subject to the SFC’s prevailing requirements for the sale of complex products8 including but not limited to ensuring the suitability of the Fund for its investors irrespective of whether solicitation or recommendation is involved.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u32.4805"}],"distinction":"Inspection of both prior models found that they already distinguish the relevant actors, underlying assets, intermediate instruments, fund-wide aggregation, exclusions and operative designation. No source-supported rival threshold rule was identified. The consequential remaining distinction is between a contemporaneous classification basis and an enduring classification status: a below-threshold snapshot without an operative designation does not resolve the effect of an earlier threshold crossing. Missing evidence also differs from evidence that a classification basis is absent. The proposal therefore retains the two classification routes while expressly limiting the question answered.","family":"time","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The assessed fund is authorised by the SFC for offering to the public in Hong Kong at the assessment time.","name":"authorised_public_fund","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u4.564"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean per fund and assessment time"},{"meaning":"The assessed fund is a listed closed-ended alternative asset fund within footnote 6's exclusion.","name":"is_laf","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u63.8691"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean per fund and assessment time"},{"meaning":"Aggregate direct exposure to private credit and private equity at the assessment time under the established measurement methodology.","name":"direct_exposure","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u1.5","d4148dd852cee.u21.3779"],"type":"integer","unit":"Exact common valuation units"},{"meaning":"Aggregate indirect exposure to private credit and private equity through all relevant holdings and instruments at the assessment time, measured under the established methodology without unintended overlap with direct exposure.","name":"indirect_exposure","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u1.5","d4148dd852cee.u21.3779","d4148dd852cee.u59.7979"],"type":"integer","unit":"Exact common valuation units"},{"meaning":"The assessed fund's NAV measured contemporaneously with both exposure amounts.","name":"nav","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u21.3779"],"type":"integer","unit":"Exact common valuation units"},{"meaning":"An actual case-specific SFC designation of this fund as a complex product applies at the assessment time. Lack of designation evidence leaves this input unknown.","name":"operative_designation","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u21.3779","d4148dd852cee.u29.4630","d4148dd852cee.u64.8910"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean per fund and assessment time"}],"result":"(or (>= (+ direct_exposure indirect_exposure direct_exposure indirect_exposure) nav) operative_designation)","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and authorised_public_fund (not is_laf) (> nav (integer 0)))"},"local_id":"current_classification_basis","questions":["Is the fund authorised for public offering in Hong Kong, and does the LAF exclusion apply?","What are the contemporaneous direct exposure, indirect exposure and positive NAV, and what methodology governs look-through, derivatives, netting and overlapping exposures?","Does an actual SFC designation apply at the assessment time?","What reassessment cadence and rules for temporary crossings, subsequent falls below 50%, or withdrawal of designation apply?","What do the missing referenced instruments require concerning LAFs, other classification bases and complex-product sales?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] Does an in-scope Fund have a contemporaneous complex-product classification basis under this circular? True means aggregate direct and indirect private-market exposure is at least 50% of NAV or an operative SFC designation exists, requiring complex-product treatment on that basis. False means both bases are absent on established facts; it does not establish declassification following an earlier threshold crossing or non-complex status under other rules. Unknown inputs remain unknown unless an independently established branch determines the result. Out-of-scope funds receive no answer. This predicate confers no legal approval.","subject":"Contemporaneous fund-level classification basis for distribution"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.11d4e8e1976eb5b2900022be","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0},{"bundle_hash":"9203254c03c8bebdd24457b8fcfd0910bc8ea510f2f3b9b2b02db6c30c4a79a1","candidate_id":"candidate.210115c491804ee183603a1943b92a2e","commitment":"241bdcebd49036f3d3ad3a42e924aeed41105988dd391e53cb9ed99d566148bf","depth":1,"disposition":"UNREVIEWED","encoding_error":null,"expanded":false,"issued_calls":0,"node_id":"node.241bdcebd49036f3d3ad3a42","order":6,"parent":"node.65050459a1ce3ffe5cff6887","reading":{"assumptions":["The circular applies at the specified assessment time; its commencement is not established by this packet.","The selected control evaluates only the two stated classification routes, not exhaustive legal status or compliance with distribution duties.","The threshold fact requires supported exposure measurement; disclosed investment maxima, instrument labels and rounded percentages cannot substitute for that evidence.","An operative designation requires evidence of an actual SFC decision, not merely a risk factor or prospective assessment.","Unknown facts remain unknown. An out-of-scope Fund receives no classification result from this control.","The expression does not resolve persistence of classification arising from an earlier threshold crossing."],"citations":[{"quote":"funds that are authorised by the SFC for offering to the public in Hong Kong (Funds)6","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u4.564"},{"quote":"6 Except for listed closed-ended alternative asset funds (LAFs).","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u63.8691"},{"quote":"A Fund will be considered as a complex product if its total direct and indirect exposures to private market assets amount to 50% or more of the Fund’s NAV.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779"},{"quote":"On a case-by-case basis, the SFC may also designate a Fund as a complex product, taking into account factors including, without limitation:","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779"},{"quote":"In assessing whether the complex product designation is warranted7, the SFC will adopt a holistic approach taking into account the specific circumstances of the case.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u29.4630"},{"quote":"In cases where the Fund’s aggregate direct and indirect exposures to private market assets are less than 50% of the Fund’s NAV.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u64.8910"},{"quote":"in the offering documents (and where appropriate, the KFS)","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u17.3223"},{"quote":"to assign an appropriate product risk rating (if applicable) for the Fund","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u39.5617"},{"quote":"In some cases, the SFC may not process the fund under the Fund Authorisation Simple Track (FASTrack).","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u46.6668"},{"quote":"take appropriate actions including updating the Fund’s offering documents as soon as practicable","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u49.6955"},{"quote":"including but not limited to ensuring the suitability of the Fund for its investors irrespective of whether solicitation or recommendation is involved.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u32.4805"}],"distinction":"The exception-attachment challenge supports retaining the parent's rule. Attaching the LAF exclusion only to disclosure fails because footnote 6 appears at the Fund definition. Treating footnote 7 as a below-50% safe harbour or as discretion to waive the threshold fails because it attaches to holistic assessment, while the preceding threshold sentence is unqualified. Extending KFS appropriateness, applicable risk ratings, FASTrack discretion or document-update timing to classification likewise lacks textual support. These failed hypotheses do not justify a competing formal rule. The strongest unresolved issue is temporal persistence: absence of both current routes does not establish that an earlier classification has ceased.","family":"exceptions","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"Whether the assessed fund is authorised by the SFC for offering to the public in Hong Kong at the assessment time.","name":"public_sfc_authorised","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u4.564"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"Whether the assessed fund is a listed closed-ended alternative asset fund within the footnote 6 exclusion.","name":"is_laf","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u63.8691"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"Whether the Fund's total direct and indirect exposure to private market assets amounts to at least 50% of its NAV at the assessment time, using the applicable methodology. Missing or unresolved measurement evidence leaves this fact unknown.","name":"aggregate_exposure_at_least_half_nav","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u1.5","d4148dd852cee.u21.3779","d4148dd852cee.u59.7979"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"Whether an SFC case-by-case designation of this Fund as a complex product under this circular is operative at the assessment time. Mere designation risk or missing records does not establish either truth value.","name":"operative_sfc_designation","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u21.3779","d4148dd852cee.u29.4630","d4148dd852cee.u64.8910"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"}],"result":"(or aggregate_exposure_at_least_half_nav operative_sfc_designation)","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and public_sfc_authorised (not is_laf))"},"local_id":"classification_routes_exception_attachment","questions":["Does a prior threshold-based classification persist after exposure falls below 50%, independently of an operative discretionary designation?","What exposure methodology and operative designation evidence permit evaluation at the selected time?","What separate treatment applies to LAFs under the absent referenced circular?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] Selected control: whether either stated classification route is satisfied for an in-scope Fund at the assessment time. True means combined direct and indirect private-market exposure is at least 50% of NAV, including exactly 50%, or an operative SFC case-by-case designation exists; the Fund must consequently be treated as complex under this reading. False means both specified routes are affirmatively absent at that time. It does not establish non-complex status, cessation of historical classification, compliance with sale requirements or an exemption under another instrument. Missing evidence does not supply a false fact.","subject":"Attachment of exclusions and qualifications to the circular's complex-product classification routes"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.65050459a1ce3ffe5cff6887","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0}],"pending":null,"provider_id":"codex.fresh.v1.compact.v2","retrievals":[{"missing_dependencies":["missing.7b393f53d503773a762cf757","missing.de6722b4a9f08d782e48c11a","missing.13ee048eabca24d91ac9305c"],"node_id":"node.65050459a1ce3ffe5cff6887","retained_uncited_units":[{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC55 chars 5:555","normative":true,"span":{"end":555,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u1.5","page":1,"quote_sha256":"600cea5ef212760b364730a35d9eb64c2be1d600f487a2c0b24f24f18cc4a593","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":5,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},"text":"The Securities and Futures Commission (SFC) has observed that investment funds may, for asset allocation and yield enhancement purposes, gain exposure to private credit and private equity (collectively, private market assets) via: direct exposure through investments in bank or non-bank direct lending in the form of loans or equities to unlisted companies (direct exposure)1; or indirect exposures2 including through investments in business development companies (BDCs)3, collateralised loan obligations (CLOs)4 or financial derivative instruments5.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u1.5"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC55 chars 1028:1928","normative":true,"span":{"end":1928,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u7.1028","page":1,"quote_sha256":"000997a593b67d38bb2f0dfb4b6bcdad0ef8827778075d340c0a3765c22529e1","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":1028,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},"text":"Direct investment in private market assets generally carries higher inherent risks than publicly listed securities, as these assets are typically illiquid, hard to value, and subject to limited regulatory oversight; they also have higher credit risks and thus higher risk of default. While indirect exposures to the private market assets may not present the same level of risk as direct investments, recent market developments have raised concerns about these indirect exposures, such as the rising default risks of underlying investments for private credit funds, widening price-to-NAV discount for listed BDCs, etc. In addition, certain indirect exposures may lack transparency about the underlying private market assets, as they involve layered structures or complex financial instruments such that retail investors may not reasonably understand the features and risks of these indirect exposures.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u7.1028"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC55 chars 1937:2462","normative":true,"span":{"end":2462,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u10.1937","page":1,"quote_sha256":"df2d22253f1deca334f7e5b69cc7a760f91a8a3d81eccddb0e5c0552e60dd419","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":1937,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},"text":"Considering that retail investors in Hong Kong may have limited familiarity with private market assets and their associated risks, fund managers should ensure that investors are provided with a clear, sufficiently complete and balanced picture of the characteristics, nature and extent of risks associated with various types of exposures a Fund may have to private market assets. Fund managers should also, among other things, ensure that the distributors chosen are appropriate for covering the target market of their Funds.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u10.1937"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC55 chars 2466:2507","normative":true,"span":{"end":2507,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u11.2466","page":1,"quote_sha256":"65f873864351bcf02f5136beb2df8209fa98c7bfccfe72daf5638dc6af69a0b7","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":2466,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},"text":"Enhanced disclosure in offering documents","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u11.2466"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC55 chars 2516:2714","normative":true,"span":{"end":2714,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u14.2516","page":1,"quote_sha256":"f87a7ece235ce425e7c34c4d7a445dffbb62055f27c0baa0df00db163562601a","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":2516,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},"text":"If a Fund may have direct or indirect exposure to private market assets, its fund manager should ensure that the Fund’s offering document (including the key facts statement (KFS)) clearly discloses:","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u14.2516"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC55 chars 2718:2991","normative":true,"span":{"end":2991,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u15.2718","page":1,"quote_sha256":"e5bb6d2bff489439e3280e594b54a336d4935d5d62aecb4af87c36d390262f46","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":2718,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},"text":"(i)        the extent and the means of access of exposure (eg, up to [x]% of the Fund’s NAV is invested in listed BDCs which primarily invest in private market assets; [x – y%] of the Fund’s NAV will gain exposure to private loans via investment in senior tranche of CLOs);","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u15.2718"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC55 chars 2995:3219","normative":true,"span":{"end":3219,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u16.2995","page":1,"quote_sha256":"b6757c15beaf52a4b636baecee09d63c2a5976eeafbdba8ebef1faa75349df6b","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":2995,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},"text":"(ii)       the nature and characteristics of the underlying private market assets (eg, the minimum credit rating of the CLOs in which the Fund invests, TRSs on an index comprising unsecuritised broadly syndicated loans); and","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u16.2995"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC55 chars 3223:3739","normative":true,"span":{"end":3739,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u17.3223","page":1,"quote_sha256":"b26f3bd1a3c0b0d312b41595a8623ae8e35922c567b62c6a2ddc57d22b2cac37","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":3223,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},"text":"(iii)      in the offering documents (and where appropriate, the KFS), the key risks associated with the Fund’s exposure to the specific types of private market assets it directly or indirectly invests in, including the impact and implications to the Fund and its investors (e.g. the limited liquidity and lack of transparency of the underlying private market assets of the BDCs can make them more challenging to value, and these valuation uncertainties may negatively impact the BDC’s NAV and hence the Fund’s NAV).","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u17.3223"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC55 chars 3743:3770","normative":true,"span":{"end":3770,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u18.3743","page":1,"quote_sha256":"e80c39d4959b49004ef67bfeb3140af9135d8d9ccd2257342f4ab21d91dee3f1","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":3743,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},"text":"Complex product designation","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u18.3743"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC55 chars 4078:4168","normative":true,"span":{"end":4168,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u22.4078","page":1,"quote_sha256":"f3ee1d7dad8976179add372f55060c71c672821730cd896668e79ac4e929eb57","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":4078,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},"text":"•        the aggregate direct and indirect exposures to private market assets of the Fund;","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u22.4078"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC55 chars 4176:4282","normative":true,"span":{"end":4282,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u24.4176","page":1,"quote_sha256":"0c86bbe0b11efe5d063e6dc17c53f5054bde551461a003cfb2dc2adff846bd4a","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":4176,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},"text":"•        the Fund's overall investment strategy, portfolio composition, and liquidity and/or risk profile;","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u24.4176"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC55 chars 4290:4497","normative":true,"span":{"end":4497,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u26.4290","page":1,"quote_sha256":"5eea0abb21a5d844ab60a8b304614d332db25e752047b4186b0b9073d03ce0dc","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":4290,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},"text":"•        the extent, nature and characteristics of the specific asset types in which the Fund invests (eg, the tranches and credit ratings of CLOs; the structure, tranches and underlying assets of SRTs); and","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u26.4290"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC55 chars 4505:4626","normative":true,"span":{"end":4626,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u28.4505","page":1,"quote_sha256":"5edeccb1cc1260c4fe7d1d44de66a3e3fbd0989d9ef1e659040f4ac002edafb8","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":4505,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},"text":"•        any distribution restrictions, requirements or other conditions as may be imposed by the Fund’s home regulators.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u28.4505"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC55 chars 5086:5140","normative":true,"span":{"end":5140,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u33.5086","page":1,"quote_sha256":"aab84c0f20b4eceaf839f4bd5d1b1a00b2d45b22cca13d57457d866ba0c28195","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":5086,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},"text":"Target market identification and distributor selection","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u33.5086"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC55 chars 5149:5608","normative":true,"span":{"end":5608,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u36.5149","page":1,"quote_sha256":"7263549aa53fca0b8b899875aa0722676e3d45a3b1908862aef9c6ca2dadb596","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":5149,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},"text":"The SFC wishes to remind fund managers to observe the requirements set out in the “Circular to Product Providers of SFC-authorized unit trusts and mutual funds, SFC-authorized investment-linked assurance schemes and SFC-authorized unlisted structured investment products – Guidance on Internal Product Approval Process”9, which outlines, among others, the requirements regarding target market identification and distributor selection for SFC-authorised funds.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u36.5149"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC55 chars 5617:6266","normative":true,"span":{"end":6266,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u39.5617","page":1,"quote_sha256":"f679bbe91887d2e0b555b914a90df586476ef45b143d90d4876785a343e90af5","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":5617,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},"text":"Fund managers should carefully identify the target market to ensure that the Fund, including its underlying investments and associated risks, would be generally understood by the target market and that the Fund’s investment objectives and risk/return profile match the needs and risk appetite of the target market. They should also ensure that the distributors chosen are appropriate for covering the target market identified, have the necessary product knowledge to understand the Fund (including whether the Fund is a complex product) and to assign an appropriate product risk rating (if applicable) for the Fund, and advise investors accordingly.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u39.5617"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC55 chars 6275:6649","normative":true,"span":{"end":6649,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u42.6275","page":1,"quote_sha256":"c887c86d7a6cc82b4d90c5ba1bbeab5feca238c9b7095a020cb07b2ee186a2be","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":6275,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},"text":"Fund managers are further reminded that the marketing materials of SFC-authorised funds must comply with the Advertising Guidelines Applicable to Collective Investment Schemes Authorized under the Product Codes10, which provide, among other requirements, that advertisements of a Fund should be fair and present a balanced picture of the Fund with adequate risk disclosures.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u42.6275"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC55 chars 6653:6659","normative":true,"span":{"end":6659,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u43.6653","page":1,"quote_sha256":"ebdad9ba4c5e3ce0078ad8e8fb31e4c76176834cd2370f05bd043e4baf8d6c5a","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":6653,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},"text":"Others","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u43.6653"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC55 chars 6668:6946","normative":true,"span":{"end":6946,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u46.6668","page":1,"quote_sha256":"3ddbf442e621eca7c09269930570d6668627239fdc599650d3a93df4c17e9b58","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":6668,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},"text":"When seeking the SFC’s authorisation for any new funds that may have direct or indirect exposure to private market assets, the fund may be subject to the SFC’s closer scrutiny. In some cases, the SFC may not process the fund under the Fund Authorisation Simple Track (FASTrack).","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u46.6668"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC55 chars 7565:7684","normative":true,"span":{"end":7684,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u52.7565","page":1,"quote_sha256":"a205fa8df5df9862415ad1d62500908b42d886948b0fc55672aa9cac780fbd46","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":7565,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},"text":"If you wish to seek clarification of any aspects of this circular, please contact the relevant case officers in charge.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u52.7565"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC55 chars 7698:7726","normative":true,"span":{"end":7726,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u55.7698","page":1,"quote_sha256":"2262a17aa8ece28244aedc22e1f37fce7075bbeb018d04e4b3b36c1c9d0199ce","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":7698,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},"text":"Investment Products Division","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u55.7698"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC55 chars 7736:7769","normative":true,"span":{"end":7769,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u56.7736","page":1,"quote_sha256":"88e2bc94e9edc39f2ac1cdaaea86b44ab5ea59b31c446f69591f21bf460b005e","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":7736,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},"text":"Securities and Futures Commission","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u56.7736"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC55 chars 7778:7974","normative":true,"span":{"end":7974,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u58.7778","page":1,"quote_sha256":"993e920b4fdde484f5649bf5273324d9a3d0a19c54930505af8bf6b2de5b1fa4","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":7778,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},"text":"1 Direct investments in/exposures to private assets fall within the investment limit of 15% of a Fund’s total net asset value (NAV) under 7.3 of the Code on Unit Trusts and Mutual Funds (UT Code).","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u58.7778"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC55 chars 7979:8158","normative":true,"span":{"end":8158,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u59.7979","page":1,"quote_sha256":"f2072cfba660bad4786ea8d85d5156b5ec263cd4739922b716a6c13008f29643","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":7979,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},"text":"2 The examples of indirect exposures set out in paragraph 1 above are non-exhaustive, and subject to review and update by the SFC from time to time in view of market developments.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u59.7979"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC55 chars 8163:8333","normative":true,"span":{"end":8333,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u60.8163","page":1,"quote_sha256":"8b6da1bcb3c06ea3c272d9e9638cb59b5d2839f45558a34a90a8da3bc00b3b97","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":8163,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},"text":"3 BDCs are close-ended funds registered under the US Investment Company Act of 1940, which primarily invest in debt and equity of small and mid-sized companies in the US.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u60.8163"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC55 chars 8338:8482","normative":true,"span":{"end":8482,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u61.8338","page":1,"quote_sha256":"3a213d70edb471ba138127b02b6e5d8002511224948fbbc1bb81d1bad8c3b5f2","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":8338,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},"text":"4 CLOs are securities backed by a pool of debt, typically leveraged loans and broadly syndicated loans, or direct lending to unlisted companies.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u61.8338"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC55 chars 8487:8686","normative":true,"span":{"end":8686,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u62.8487","page":1,"quote_sha256":"b27e41864de598834dd1ec89777e83e73906a395dea432fb5a2456b6f952e467","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":8487,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},"text":"5 For example, Total Return Swaps on indices with exposure to leveraged loans or broadly syndicated loans (TRSs), or Significant Risk Transfers with underlying assets that are corporate loans (SRTs).","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u62.8487"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC55 chars 9044:9299","normative":true,"span":{"end":9299,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u65.9044","page":1,"quote_sha256":"9ca08a544160df2030cf1e630fd6126d41f6da848ca7f8e70b81dd1330f4fae8","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":9044,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},"text":"8 Paragraph 5.5 of the SFC’s Code of Conduct for Persons Licensed by or Registered with the Securities and Futures Commission and Chapter 6 of the SFC’s Guidelines on Online Distribution and Advisory Platforms, and the relevant Frequently Asked Questions.","unit_id":"d4148dd852cee.u65.9044"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC55 chars 9304:9504","normative":true,"span":{"end":9504,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u66.9304","page":1,"quote_sha256":"317064812f348e9ab6464a050589a01364293a4172c91fd379ed15af4397dd8b","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":9304,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},"text":"9